{"hits": {"hits": [{"created": "2026-10-15T10:30:58.597543+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-15T10:30:58.922225+00:00", "id": 23392409, "conceptrecid": "23392408", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23392409", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23392408", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23392409", "metadata": {"title": "Five outgoing centers in a 16-realization cube move", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23392409", "publication_date": "2026-10-15", "description": "This note specifies six fixed algebraic boundary points admitting an incoming alpha=16 realization and at least five distinct outgoing centers. Exact rational bounds, the intermediate value theorem and monotone polynomial root definitions prove the construction. It contradicts the at-most-three expectation in Melotti\u2013Ramassamy\u2013Th\u00e9venin (2023), Remark 4.8, in the realization setting allowing crossings. A fixed boundary crossing excludes proper embeddings. The exact total count and universal maximum remain unknown. The curves are members of the earlier weighted-distance and p-power families of Ash\u2013Bolker (1986), Bourne\u2013Peletier\u2013Roper (2014) and Bourne\u2013Roper (2015). A bounded search through 15 October 2026 located no earlier pure-power four-or-more shared-focus example in its checked corpus; historical priority remains unestablished. AI was used extensively. This preprint is unrefereed and has not received conventional human peer review.", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kriebel, Alec", "affiliation": "Independent researcher", "orcid": "0009-0001-9320-500X"}], "keywords": ["alpha-realizations", "cube moves", "p-power diagrams", "weighted-distance bisectors", "exact rational interval arithmetic"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.4171/AIHPD/163", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.4171/OWR/2020/35", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1007/BF00164401", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1137/130922732", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1137/141000993", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23392408"}}]}}, "title": "Five outgoing centers in a 16-realization cube move", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23392409", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23392409", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23392409?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23392409", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23392409", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23392409", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23392409/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23392408", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23392408", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23392408", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23392408", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23392409/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23392409/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23392409/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23392409/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23392409:five_centers.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23392409:five_centers.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23392409:five_centers.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23392409:five_centers.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23392409:five_centers.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23392409:five_centers.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/defaul